   "text": "Gatekeeper Tamil: Do you know Oren's Ivory Tower? Do you also know that I'm one of only a few Orcs who has received into the Magic Gatekeeper Guild? Ah, you don't know what Oren's Ivory Tower is? How can you not know the centre of magic where the most brilliant wizards in the world gather? Oh ho, r…",
