     "script": "Q00009_IntoTheCityOfHumans",
     "event": "30576-02.html",
     "quest": 9,
     "to": "Q00009_IntoTheCityOfHumans/30576-02.html",
     "effect": "reward"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00277_GatekeepersOffering/30576-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00277_GatekeepersOffering/30576-02.htm",
   "quest": 277,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Tamil: The magic power I learned from the Ivory Tower of Oren allows me to control the door of space time. It is almost miraculous, being able to reach a town on the other side of the continent with only a few steps. But I am ashamed to admit that my understanding of Human magic is incom…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Tamil",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Say you will help",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00277_GatekeepersOffering 30576-03.htm",
