  "Q00009_IntoTheCityOfHumans/30576-02.html": {
   "file": "Q00009_IntoTheCityOfHumans/30576-02.html",
   "quest": 9,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Tamil: Giran is very far from here. Here's a magic scroll that allows you to use the gate of time and space. It's a scroll called the Scroll of Escape to the Town of Giran . This is valuable, you can use it only once ! Use it wisely. I will put it in your quest item window. I'll give you…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Tamil",
   "sets": {
    "reward": true
   },
   "outcome": "reward",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00277_GatekeepersOffering/30576-01.htm": {
   "file": "Q00277_GatekeepersOffering/30576-01.htm",
   "quest": 277,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Tamil: Thank you, but this is too dangerous for you. Don't you know? In order to collect Starstones, you must defeat the greystone golems on the Immortal Plateau. But these golems are too strong for you. (Quest for characters level 15 and above.)",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Tamil",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00277_GatekeepersOffering/30576-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00277_GatekeepersOffering/30576-03.htm",
   "quest": 277,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Tamil: Thank you! I will not forget your kindness. But are you sure you know what is required? Every golem carries a Starstone in its body. According to the Seers, the power of the stars contained within the Starstone is the force that keeps the golems alive and moving. Anyway, if you de…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Tamil",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
